        {
          "text": "MongoDB Atlas CloudFormation resources support AtlasGov; the repository recommends IsMongoDBGovCloud=true in the profile secret and states that an explicit BaseUrl takes precedence over that flag. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-31)",
